---
import SlideLayout from "../../../components/presentations/hosting-at-home/SlideLayout.astro";
import ContentSlide from "../../../components/presentations/hosting-at-home/ContentSlide.astro";
---

<SlideLayout title="Hardening">
    <ContentSlide title="Secure Cloudflare" eyebrow="Hardening part 2">
        <ul>
            <li>Enable <strong>WAF managed rules</strong> for your hostname</li>
            <li>Set up <strong>rate limiting</strong> rules for login endpoints</li>
            <li>
                Use <strong>Cloudflare Access</strong> to put SSO/MFA in front of anything semi-private
            </li>
            <li>Turn on <strong>Bot Fight Mode</strong> in your zone settings</li>
        </ul>
    </ContentSlide>
</SlideLayout>
